        <strong>Strategic Insight:</strong> Markets with high professional host concentration (Bangkok, Barcelona) face greater regulatory scrutiny and may be more resilient to restrictions targeting individual hosts. However, Amsterdam's low concentration suggests a market particularly sensitive to regulatory changes affecting small operators.
    </div>
</section>

<section id="demand">
    <h2>4. Guest Demand & Review Activity</h2>

    <h3>Average Reviews per Month by City</h3>
    <div class="chart-container">
