        <h4>Rome Offers Highest Demand Intensity</h4>
        <p>With <span class="stat">1.77 reviews/month</span> and 382,872 total reviews, Rome demonstrates the strongest guest engagement per listing despite mid-range pricing. This suggests favorable unit economics for operators entering that market.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="takeaway">
        <span class="number">5</span>
        <h4>Availability Patterns Reveal Regulatory Environments</h4>
        <p>Amsterdam's 92-day average vs Bangkok's 253 days reflects divergent regulatory approaches. Markets with lower availability (Amsterdam, Paris) may face upcoming supply constraints if regulations tighten further.</p>
    </div>
